msgctxt "#32311"
msgid "Native leaves HLS handling to Kodi. Ask quality uses the original HLS master URL and InputStream Adaptive, matching the proven 0.7.12 playback path. Adaptive bitrate uses InputStream Adaptive automatically. Buffered Look Ahead Playback uses Appi's disk-backed localhost HLS proxy with an approximately 30-second media reserve."
msgstr "Native leaves HLS handling to Kodi. Ask quality uses the original HLS master URL and InputStream Adaptive. Adaptive bitrate uses InputStream Adaptive automatically. Buffered Look Ahead Playback uses Appi's disk-backed localhost HLS proxy with an approximately 30-second media reserve."

